# title: Sprout Swarm repeated into two Soul Wardens: once their life gain resolves between casts, each Saproling gives the opponent 2 life for 1 power, so lethal only gets further away; the loop shortcut stops it as stalled instead of running on (patch 48; the study case was Zhulodok's Wandering Archaics copying each cast, study150_20261014 V02 g4) Since patch 52 the Wardens' triggers resolve between iterations, so the loss shows at once: Forge stops casting within about 20 iterations, before the stall count, and the loop never jumps.
